.TH STRALLOC_CATQ 3 "2023-10-15" "c-utils" "String Allocation Functions"
.SH NAME
 stralloc_catq \- Append a quoted string to a string
.SH LIBRARY
 libstralloc
.SH SYNOPSIS
 .B #include <stralloc/stralloc.h>

 .B void
 stralloc_catq(stralloc *sa, const char *s);
.SH DESCRIPTION
 Appends the quoted string s to the string allocation object sa. This function
 is used for safely appending quoted strings in the c-utils library.
.SH RETURN VALUES
 None. Errors are reported via standard I/O or logging mechanisms.
.SH SEE ALSO
 stralloc_cat(3), stralloc_catb(3)
.SH AUTHORS
 Written by the c-utils development team.